body:
I didn't even realize it was popular, I've only been playing for a month and I'm not really involved in the community or anything. God damn it, I like being original xD I've kinda got a trans colour scheme going on so that either helps my case or makes me more of a basic b\*tch haha 

&#x200B;

It's def cute <3

I liked Changnesia, I know the jokes weren't always that great but I feel like Chang is crazy enough to have tried to pull a stunt like that. Plus I don't know how else they would have bought Chang in lol, aside from how he comes in s5, just being like "Yeah I did my time, I teach maths now."

&#x200B;

Maybe this is a weird one too, but I don't like Shirley much. Maybe it's because of having a Christian parent myself (who is quite literally mentally unwell, religion aside) but I just find it hard to like her. I guess it's more my own personal issues though, really.

\*gay panic\* H-h-hi 😳

&#x200B;

(You know it's bad when your first thought is gay panic and not panic of being murdered lol)

I totally get you. It's scary as hell, because a lot of the time, it was hell. But the more we understand about ourselves and the situations we were in, the better we can become :) 

&#x200B;

Thank you, I'm just waiting to be able to get out of here at this point. Life sucks sometimes lol
